  "title": "#MMC35 Campaign Launches @ 90s Con Daytona Beach",
  "date": "2024-11-01T11:41:42.939Z",
  "description": "Always In The Club teamed up with That's 4 Entertainment and Halifax Repertory Theatre on launching our #MMC35 campaign celebrating the 35th anniversary of The 'All New' Mickey Mouse Club at 90s Con Daytona Beach 2024. The campaign promotes our youth arts, education and mentoring programs. The launch was supported by 12 reunited Mouseketeers and That's 4 Entertainment who brought together several celebrity icons of the 1990s, including Heather Locklear, Juliette Lewis, Joey Lawrence, Joey Fatone",
  "heroImage": {
    "src": "https://static.wixstatic.com/media/3ee52e_f2eb3105334847d0ace886fabff2ac85~mv2.jpg/v1/fill/w_1200,h_675,al_c,q_90/file.jpg",
    "alt": "#MMC35 Campaign Launches @ 90s Con Daytona Beach"
  },
  "blocks": [
