    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "html": "<a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.mickeymouseclubreunion.com/aitcfoundation\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><u>Always In The Club</u></a> teamed up with <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.thats4entertainment.com/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><u>That's 4 Entertainment</u></a> and <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.halifaxrep.com/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><u>Halifax Repertory Theatre</u></a> on launching our <a href=\"https://www.mickeymouseclubreunion.com/events/hashtags/MMC35\" target=\"_blank\">#MMC35</a> campaign celebrating the 35th anniversary of The 'All New' Mickey Mouse Club at <strong>90s Con Daytona Beach</strong> <strong>2024</strong>."
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "html": "The campaign promotes our youth arts, education and mentoring programs. The launch was supported by 12 reunited Mouseketeers and That's 4 Entertainment who brought together several celebrity icons of the 1990s, including Heather Locklear, Juliette Lewis, Joey Lawrence, Joey Fatone, and cast reunions of Charmed, 90210, Melrose Place, and Sabrina the Teenage Witch, among others."
