    {
      "type": "p",
      "html": "Hosted by That’s4Entertainment, this year marked the first time 90s Con was held in Daytona Beach. Ormond Beach's Halifax Repertory Theater powered the campaign by providing financial support. Among the 12 Mouseketeers in attendance was Jennifer McGill who is also the artistic director of the Halifax Repertory Theater."
    },
    {
      "type": "h4",
      "text": "Day One at 90s Con 2024:"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "html": "Day one featured rehearsals at Halifax for the 90s Con official after-party. We then hit the red carpet and ended the evening back at Halifax Repertory Theatre for our Club Member Meet-up featuring a super fun Karaoke Pizza Party hosted by Mouseketeer Jennifer McGill!"
    },
    {
      "type": "video",
      "kind": "mp4",
      "src": "https://video.wixstatic.com/video/3ee52e_a1bab6f0fcf345538515446ecb07645e/720p/mp4/file.mp4"
    },
    {
      "type": "h4",
      "text": "One of the highlights of the weekend of events was during the After-Party produced by Always In the Club:"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "html": "The founders of 90s Con were inducted into our <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.mickeymouseclubreunion.com/hall-of-fame\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><u>MMC'89 HALL OF FAME</u></a> by <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.mickeymouseclubreunion.com/aitcfoundation\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><u>Always In The Club Foundation</u></a> board members Jennifer McGill, Tony Lucca and Chasen Hampton, along with program manager Dale Godboldo and Halifax's Jack and Sandy Cook."
    },
    {
      "type": "img",
      "src": "https://static.wixstatic.com/media/3ee52e_c6e521b01a37451d8f8a8a7b1b86d61d~mv2.jpg/v1/fill/w_800,h_800,al_c,q_85/file.jpg",
      "alt": "",
      "placement": "inline"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "html": "90s Con reunites the most iconic stars of the era and has been named by People Magazine as one of the Top 100 Reasons to Love America. <strong>Liliana Kligman</strong> and <strong>Christina Figliolia</strong> were honored for their work in transforming nostalgia into impact."
    },
    {
      "type": "img",
      "src": "https://static.wixstatic.com/media/3ee52e_b96dd79b1e5f467cbe25aaa8e588e7dd~mv2.webp/v1/fill/w_800,h_800,al_c,q_85/file.jpg",
      "alt": "",
      "placement": "inline"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "html": "Another highlight was the House of Halliwell Tribute to Shannen Doherty that was presented by Always In The Club and featured the cast of “Charmed” and Brian Austin Green of “Beverly Hills 90210.”"
    },
    {
      "type": "img",
      "src": "https://static.wixstatic.com/media/3ee52e_480e2e8394654aa9a47f5bbd25cc9424~mv2.jpg/v1/fill/w_800,h_800,al_c,q_85/file.jpg",
      "alt": "",
      "placement": "inline"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "html": "And of course there was the After-party hosted by Mouseketeer <strong>Lindsey Alley</strong> and featuring performances by <strong>O-Town</strong>, <strong>En Vogue's Rhona Bennett</strong>, and <strong>The Party</strong>, with Mouseketeers <strong>Tony Lucca</strong> and <strong>Jennifer McGill. </strong>The evening featured The Party being inducted into the <strong>New England Hall of Fame!</strong>"
    },
    {
      "type": "img",
      "src": "https://static.wixstatic.com/media/3ee52e_f0f0756451704b8f81ed3bfd5e6024d3~mv2.jpg/v1/fill/w_800,h_800,al_c,q_85/file.jpg",
      "alt": "",
      "placement": "gallery"
    },
    {
      "type": "img",
      "src": "https://static.wixstatic.com/media/3ee52e_d5ea76e2e7eb40fba06243386ca895da~mv2.webp/v1/fill/w_800,h_800,al_c,q_85/file.jpg",
      "alt": "",
      "placement": "gallery"
    },
    {
      "type": "img",
      "src": "https://static.wixstatic.com/media/3ee52e_50f35057d43c4f9f8fe079b5fc59059e~mv2.png/v1/fill/w_800,h_800,al_c,q_85/file.jpg",
      "alt": "",
      "placement": "gallery"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "html": "The weekend of events ended with our <strong>MMC'89 Day of Service</strong>. Always In The Club teamed up with Halifax Repertory Theatre on a special Film & TV acting masterclass for youth and a Q&A session for their parents 🎭"
    },
    {
      "type": "img",
      "src": "https://static.wixstatic.com/media/3ee52e_a3384404a2554d79aa6be8b763297ecb~mv2.jpg/v1/fill/w_800,h_800,al_c,q_85/file.jpg",
      "alt": "",
      "placement": "inline"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "html": "The class was led by Mouseketeer <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://dale-godboldo.com/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><u>Dale Godboldo</u></a> (<em>The People v OJ Simpson, HBO's Perry Mason, The Sum of All Fears</em>) with support from Halifax's <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.jennifermcgill.com/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><u>Jennifer McGill</u></a> (also a Mouseketeer)."
    },
    {
      "type": "img",
      "src": "https://static.wixstatic.com/media/3ee52e_7f00834384ce47b399000d46ec81d7df~mv2.jpg/v1/fill/w_800,h_800,al_c,q_85/file.jpg",
      "alt": "",
      "placement": "gallery"
    },
    {
      "type": "img",
      "src": "https://static.wixstatic.com/media/3ee52e_002620d9405c458fad90f2b2bbdfc13b~mv2.jpg/v1/fill/w_800,h_800,al_c,q_85/file.jpg",
      "alt": "",
      "placement": "gallery"
    },
    {
      "type": "img",
      "src": "https://static.wixstatic.com/media/3ee52e_5ae28afd51604bed811658baedbcf55e~mv2.jpg/v1/fill/w_800,h_800,al_c,q_85/file.jpg",
      "alt": "",
      "placement": "gallery"
    },
    {
      "type": "img",
      "src": "https://static.wixstatic.com/media/3ee52e_c2ca2e05f449498c9d070e326556f756~mv2.jpg/v1/fill/w_800,h_800,al_c,q_85/file.jpg",
      "alt": "",
      "placement": "gallery"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "html": "Halifax Repertory Theatre is a pillar of the Ormond/Daytona Beach creative community, and we couldn't be more proud to support them and their young artists through our <strong>MMC'89 Day of Service</strong>. These kids were AMAZING and we were honored to teach them... and in fact learn from them. Thanks for having us, HRT! Visit Halifax Repertory Theatre to learn more about their work: <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.halifaxrep.com/\" rel=\"noopener\"><u>https://www.halifaxrep.com/</u></a>"
    },
