    {
      "type": "h3",
      "text": "EXCLUSIVE PRESS ANNOUNCEMENT: Former Mickey Mouse Club Mouseketeers Are Set to Bring the Magic to 90s Con Florida (Exclusive) | SEE STORY",
      "html": "EXCLUSIVE PRESS ANNOUNCEMENT: Former Mickey Mouse Club Mouseketeers Are Set to Bring the Magic to 90s Con Florida (Exclusive) | <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" href=\"https://people.com/former-mickey-mouse-club-mouseketeers-attending-90s-con-florida-exclusive-8676789\">SEE STORY</a>"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "html": "<strong><em>By Dory Jackson | a Staff Editor for PEOPLE's TV News team. Published on July 12, 2024 12:00PM EDT</em></strong><em> </em>"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "html": "It's time to get the party started!"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "html": "PEOPLE can exclusively confirm that former members of <em>The Mickey Mouse Club</em> are heading to 90s Con Florida in September. So far, <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/deedeemagnohallofficial/?hl=en\" rel=\"noopener\">Deedee Magno Hall</a>, En Vogue's <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/officialmissrnb/?hl=en\" rel=\"noopener\">Rhona Bennett</a>, <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/luccadoes/?hl=en\" rel=\"noopener\">Tony Lucca</a>, <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/chasen_hampton/?hl=en\" rel=\"noopener\">Chasen Hampton</a>, <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/my_roque/?hl=en\" rel=\"noopener\">Raquel Herring</a>, <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/thejennifermcgill/?hl=en\" rel=\"noopener\">Jennifer McGill</a>, <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/damonppampolina/?hl=en\" rel=\"noopener\">Damon Pampolina</a>, <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/dalegodboldo/?hl=en\" rel=\"noopener\">Dale Godboldo</a>, <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/mslindseyalley/?hl=en\" rel=\"noopener\">Lindsey Alley</a>, <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/davidkaterofficial/?hl=en\" rel=\"noopener\">David Kater</a>, <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/mylinstoddard/?hl=en\" rel=\"noopener\">Mylin Brooks</a> and <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/albertjeunepierrefields/\" rel=\"noopener\">Albert Fields</a> are the confirmed Mouseketeers who are ready to bring the magic and fun to the gathering, helmed by <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.thats4entertainment.com/\" rel=\"noopener\">That's 4 Entertainment</a>."
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "html": "\"I'm looking forward to dipping into the 90s nostalgia,\" member Rhona Bennett says in a statement shared with PEOPLE. \"The music, the style, the shows, the life before social media. As Kenny Rogers and Dolly Parton's song says, 'You can't make old friends.' Well, it's almost time to hang with the buddies again. See y'all soon!\""
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "html": "\"I love every opportunity to gather with my MMC family, and what better place to reminisce about our Wonder Years than at 90’s Con,\" says Deedee Magno Hall."
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "html": "Tony Lucca says the whole crew is \"super stoked not only to be asked back to That's 4 Entertainment's 90s Con, but to be celebrating 35 years of<em> The All-New Mickey Mouse Club</em> amongst our 90s peers, fans, and friends.\" The star also notes that they \"had a blast at the inaugural 90s Con in '22, and I look forward to picking up where we left off with THAT after-party!\""
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "html": "Additionally, Jennifer McGill calls the joint appearance \"a special opportunity for my past and present worlds to collide in celebrating this incredible decade that brought so much joy.\" \"Always In The Club & Halifax Repertory Theatre both have a heart for enriching young artists’ lives through education and mentorship,\" she says. \"It is my honor to be a part of That’s 4 Entertainment’s 90s Con, commemorating the decade when I decided to work in the arts for the rest of my life.\""
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "html": "The event is running from September 13-15 at the Ocean Center in Daytona Beach, Florida. The Mouseketeers in attendance this year will appear throughout the weekend during photo ops with fans and more."
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "html": "Previously announced casts reuniting include <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://people.com/tv/beverly-hills-90210-where-are-they-now/\" rel=\"noopener\"><em>Beverly Hills, 90210</em></a>, <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://people.com/melrose-place-alums-courtney-thorne-smith-laura-leighton-daphne-zuniga-launch-rewatch-podcast-exclusive-8674440\" rel=\"noopener\"><em>Melrose Place</em></a>, <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://people.com/charmed-cast-where-are-they-now-8348660\" rel=\"noopener\"><em>Charmed</em></a> and <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://people.com/beverley-mitchell-jessica-biel-virtually-reunited-7th-heaven-cast-90s-con-8610213\" rel=\"noopener\"><em>7th Heaven</em></a>. <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://people.com/tag/juliette-lewis/\" rel=\"noopener\">Juliette Lewis</a>, <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://people.com/tag/carmen-electra/\" rel=\"noopener\">Carmen Electra</a> and <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://people.com/tag/jaleel-white/\" rel=\"noopener\">Jaleel White</a> are also some of the big names set to appear at the weekend-long event."
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "html": "Additionally, PEOPLE can confirm that the <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.mickeymouseclubreunion.com/aitcfoundation\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Always In The Club Foundation</a><strong> </strong>will serve as the event's official charity partner<strong> </strong>this year."
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "html": "Co-founded by reunited cast members from <em>The All-New Mickey Mouse Club </em>and more than 10,000 dedicated fans, the nonprofit organization is inspired by the support that the Mouseketeers received from Disney while young. It also serves as the beneficiary of the celebrity memorabilia auction and will be hosting a <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.tapkat.org/always-in-the-club-foundation/49oNWk\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">sweepstakes to win two free VIP tickets</a>."
    },
